
=== start_of_the_game ===
You are wizardo. A wizard renowned for his power. Even among all the wizards of the land, you are a cut above the rest. But to you, this is isn't what you want. 

You seek nothing short of total ultimate power. You don't want to be known as powerful, you want to be synonymous with power. This thought creeps in the back of your mind until you finally had enough

You decide to put all of your wizarding knowledge together towards one final ritual. A ritual, that if it works, would finally grant you all the power you seek. You gather all the necissary resources and plan for months, until finally you finish the ritual. 

...At first a rumbling, 
...then screams, 
...then the world goes dark.

All in a moment, it returns, but not like it once was. You find that the world that you once knew has merged with a much darker one, a world of cruel technology and oppressive force. It's up to you to fix your mistake and possibly achieve the power you once seeked. 


=== good_reflection ===
You take a moment to reflect on your journey, and how it has changed you. 

You haven't taken any of the technology items, and have remain uncomprimised to its corruptive power. Although this path is harder, you feel that this is the right way

You still must carry on



=== bad_refection ===
You take a moment to reflect on your journey, and how it has changed you. 

You've taken same of the technology items, and can feel its corruptive influence over you. You must be careful, if you don't, you could lose yourself to its will. You are powerful, but do you really think you can overcome what their world failed to?

You still must carry on




=== bad_ending ===
You have beaten the final creature of this world and claimed its power for your own. You truely are the most powerful being in all the combined realms. 

However, the corruptive influence of the tech that you so carelessly binded yourself to has taken over your mind.

Your will is no longer your own. You will be the same oppresive force that dictated their world, only stronger now. Friends and foes fall to you all the same. You have won, but at what cost. 



bad_ending


=== good_ending ===
You have beaten the final creature of this world and claimed its power for your own. You truely are the most powerful being in all the combined realms. 

You decided not to bind yourself to any technology, proving that you never needed the corruptive power of their world, by your own will and your own strength you have proven yourself the most powerful being. 

With your will intact you rule as a benevolent immortal leader, preserving the good of your of what was once your world, and freeing the minds and tech of the corrupting evil that plagued the world now combined with your own.

You truely have won.

good_ending

=== middle_ending ===
You have beaten the final creature of this world and claimed its power for your own. You truely are the most powerful being in all the combined realms. 

You deciced to bind yourself to some technology. Trusting that through balance you would be able to overcome the will of the corruptive evil plaguing the tech. 

As the most powerful being in the now combined worlds. You decide to take control, as the immortal leader. 

You promise to bring peace to all the lands, but is that a promise you can keep. Will the technology and the evil of their world some day corrupt you? It is the chance you have taken on this path. 

neutral_ending





